167
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,240
Brother Wang !

168
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,040
What's the matter ?

169
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,240
Master Sun led us all the way

170
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,800
