185
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,120
Brother Wang...

186
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,600
Brother Wang...

187
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,440
Help me !

188
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,480
