281
00:18:32,160 --> 00:18:33,200
This is it !

282
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,040
Attack !

283
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:49,920
Restriction Spears !

284
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:10,560
Chi Mu\NForsaken Immortal Clan\N6-leaf Warrior

285
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,560
A Warrior...

286
00:19:32,610 --> 00:19:35,910
To let go of the consequences of my actions

287
00:19:35,910 --> 00:19:37,630
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

288
00:19:37,670 --> 00:19:39,570
like scattered ink.

289
00:19:40,450 --> 00:19:47,050
As destiny falls

290
00:19:43,290 --> 00:19:47,050
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

291
00:19:47,050 --> 00:19:54,650
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

292
00:19:50,290 --> 00:19:54,650
wither and melt into rivers.

293
00:19:55,090 --> 00:20:02,210
Who can deceive

294
00:19:57,850 --> 00:20:02,210
the law of the heavens ?

295
00:20:02,530 --> 00:20:05,530
Countless generations

296
00:20:03,810 --> 00:20:05,530
have tried before me.

297
00:20:05,820 --> 00:20:09,250
But how could I not catch my dreams

298
00:20:07,650 --> 00:20:09,250
within my warm fingers ?

299
00:20:09,810 --> 00:20:13,330
You're at my side when I'm alone

300
00:20:13,330 --> 00:20:16,650
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

301
00:20:17,410 --> 00:20:20,610
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

302
00:20:20,970 --> 00:20:24,810
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

303
00:20:22,810 --> 00:20:24,810
in the streets.

304
00:20:24,970 --> 00:20:29,770
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

305
00:20:26,530 --> 00:20:29,770
Can I break the rules ?

306
00:20:29,780 --> 00:20:32,490
To run towards you !

307
00:20:32,530 --> 00:20:35,810
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

308
00:20:35,810 --> 00:20:40,450
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

309
00:20:40,450 --> 00:20:43,850
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

310
00:20:43,890 --> 00:20:48,530
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

311
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:54,210
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

312
00:20:54,330 --> 00:20:58,130
If your soul is willing to wander,

313
00:20:58,130 --> 00:21:02,770
can I still take your hands

314
00:20:59,810 --> 00:21:02,770
and hold them tight ?

315
00:21:02,930 --> 00:21:05,850
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

316
00:21:05,850 --> 00:21:10,730
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

317
00:21:10,740 --> 00:21:14,010
I dream of destroying

318
00:21:14,170 --> 00:21:18,730
the shackles of our fate.

319
00:21:18,730 --> 00:21:22,690
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

320
00:21:22,690 --> 00:21:25,490
You're the hardest to let go of.

321
00:21:25,570 --> 00:21:29,370
I want to be with you again

322
00:21:29,450 --> 00:21:32,730
so I can look in your eyes.

323
00:21:33,010 --> 00:21:37,970
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
